<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="p0" name="v11.3 lineage"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2200" pageHeight="1300" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="How v11.3 was built: two lines meet" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2000" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Line A builds the image encoder (v1 → v10.3). Line B builds the classifier (v11 GAN). v11.3 = v11's classifier on v10.3's LoRA image features. Test numbers unless marked val; γ0 = no calibration." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=12;align=left;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="56" width="2100" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Line A · image encoder&lt;/b&gt; (zero-shot → learned prompts on frozen CLIP)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=12;align=left;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="900" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;v1 base&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;zero-shot CLIP, raw names&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;5.4&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;5.4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 2.0 · closed unseen 43.1&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): –" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;v2 clean names&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;typos fixed, common names, 5 templates&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;5.6&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;5.6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 2.6 · closed unseen 47.2&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): –" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="140" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;v3 knowledge base&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;symptom description in every prompt&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;10.2&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;10.2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 3.4 · closed unseen 48.5&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): –" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="140" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;v4 prompt learning (CSP)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;1 learned vector per crop / disease; γ introduced&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;43.5&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;34.9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 38.4 · closed unseen 80.7&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): –" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="140" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;v4.1 γ fix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;real unseen hidden in val, 40-image cap, lower lr&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;52.9&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;26.1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 38.9 · closed unseen 73.8&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): –" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="140" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;v4.2 3-split val&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;γ / epoch chosen on 3 splits&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;51.8&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;26.0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 38.4 · closed unseen 75.6&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 46.6 / 15.3" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="140" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;Line A · image encoder&lt;/b&gt; (LoRA on the CLIP image encoder)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=12;align=left;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="312" width="900" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;v5 LoRA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;LoRA on last 4 image blocks (+ augmentation)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;65.1&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;26.1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 55.3 · closed unseen 86.7&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 51.2 / 10.9 (1 split)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="350" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;v5.5 (= v5.3)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;bigger LoRA: last 8 blocks, rank 16&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;64.5&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;40.3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 56.0 · closed unseen 86.1&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 56.9 / 9.2 (1 split)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="350" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;v5.8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;same model, re-measured on 3 splits&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;64.2&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;39.8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 56.0 · closed unseen 85.2&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 59.8 / 14.8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1650" y="350" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;v10.3 text anchor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;learned text vectors pulled to their CLIP start&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;66.3&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;33.5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 56.2 · closed unseen 86.8&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 61.2 / 15.3" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1880" y="350" width="200" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;Line B · classifier&lt;/b&gt; (feature generation, f-CLSWGAN)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=12;align=left;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="572" width="700" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;v11 feature generation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;GAN: text → image features; 300 fake features per unseen pair; cosine classifier. Frozen CLIP features&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;57.8&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;24.2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 42.6 · closed unseen 71.3&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 49.2 / 15.1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="610" width="200" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;b&gt;v11.3 lora_features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;v11 on v10.3's LoRA image features&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;64.9&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;44.0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 52.7 · closed unseen 82.5&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 60.2 / &lt;b&gt;28.6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;best uncalibrated CLIP model&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1880" y="610" width="220" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="image encoder&lt;br&gt;(LoRA features)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="GAN + classifier" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c26" target="c27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;b&gt;Frozen text prompts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;from v2 (clean names, 5 templates) and v3 (symptom descriptions)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;no learned vectors&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="630" width="190" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="condition +&lt;br&gt;classifier start" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;dashed=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a6a00;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c30" target="c26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;b&gt;v11.2 ablation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;no generated features&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;41.9&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;0.0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 24.9 · closed unseen 47.0&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 37.0 / 0.0" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="830" width="200" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="&lt;b&gt;v11.1 (not kept)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;generator also conditioned on crop + disease&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HM cal &lt;b&gt;59.7&lt;/b&gt; · HM γ0 &lt;b&gt;6.2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSUC 44.2 · closed unseen 75.0&lt;br&gt;val (cal / γ0): 50.8 / 5.0" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1650" y="830" width="200" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c26" target="c32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c26" target="c33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Solid arrows: each run is its parent plus the change in italics. Thick border = a step that matters most for v11.3.&lt;br&gt;• Dashed orange arrow: v11's text side is frozen CLIP's embedding of the v3 prompts. v11.3 does &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; use v10.3's learned crop / disease vectors or its text anchor; those only shaped the LoRA encoder while it was trained.&lt;br&gt;• Colours: grey = zero-shot · blue = learned prompts on frozen CLIP · purple = LoRA · orange = GAN branch · dashed white = ablations · green = v11.3.&lt;br&gt;• HM cal = calibrated with γ (the usual protocol). HM γ0 = no calibration (mostly measures seen bias). AUSUC and closed-set unseen do not depend on γ (recognition)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="350" width="1100" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="&lt;b&gt;Where v11.3's uncalibrated HM (44.0) comes from&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;Generated unseen features: essential.&lt;/b&gt; Without them (v11.2) HM γ0 is 0.0: a classifier that never sees unseen-pair features never picks an unseen pair. With 300 fake features per unseen pair, the classifier no longer leans heavily to seen pairs.&lt;br&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;LoRA features: +19.8&lt;/b&gt; (v11 24.2 → v11.3 44.0). The GAN copies sharper, leaf-adapted features.&lt;br&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;GAN classifier instead of learned prompts: +10.5&lt;/b&gt; (v10.3 33.5 → v11.3 44.0, same image features). Its seen-vs-unseen offset is about 2.5× smaller.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Recognition (AUSUC) was built earlier, in line A:&lt;/b&gt; descriptions (v3, biggest zero-shot gain), CSP prompt learning (+35 AUSUC, v3 → v4), LoRA (+17, v4.2 → v5). Swapping v10.3's prompts for the GAN classifier &lt;b&gt;costs&lt;/b&gt; recognition: AUSUC −3.5, closed unseen −4.3, calibrated HM −1.4." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff0f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="610" width="1100" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;b&gt;Caveats&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• v11.3's classifier was selected at &lt;b&gt;epoch 1&lt;/b&gt;: it overfits fast because the training features come from an encoder trained on the same images.&lt;br&gt;• Its epoch was chosen by calibrated validation HM, not at γ = 0.&lt;br&gt;• Several inherited steps were not 'kept' by the +2 rule (v10.3 +1.4; v5.8 is only a re-measure); v11.3 carries them because it uses v10.3's encoder." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="930" width="1100" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>